<urn:atm:triage:finding/CPR-004>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "CPR-004" ;
  triage:title "task_started receipt interrupts the assigner with NudgeMode::Immediate regardless of their state" ;
  triage:description "Hostile closure review (general-purpose opus, task af4edaf6699568f49) @ 9f5aef2fe. task_started receipt interrupts the assigner with NudgeMode::Immediate regardless of their state. Doc says: nudge-task-design.md §1 arm 3: active -> 'LEAVE ALONE -- never divert'. sprint-BA.4 AC5 requires assignment-path writes to be Deferred (`grep -n 'NudgeMode::Immediate' crates/atm/src/commands/task.rs` -> nothing). Code does: The daemon-side start handoff builds the task_started receipt to the assigner `.with_nudge_mode(NudgeMode::Immediate)`, which prompts the assigner's session immediately even when the assigner is Active on their own task. Recommendation: Either make the receipt Deferred, or record a design ruling that receipts are an exception to §1 arm 3 and add it to the design doc's invariant table. fenix's ruling: the task_started receipt is Deferred, not an exception to design section 1 arm 3." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-ba" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
  triage:category "correctness" ;
  triage:severity "important" ;
  triage:source "qa" ;
  triage:repeatable false ;
  triage:sweepScope "crates/atm-http-runtime/src/herdr_task_start.rs" ;
  triage:status "fixed" ;
  triage:dispatchReady false ;
  triage:triagedAt "2026-09-12T07:08:18Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:deferredNote "fenix (ATM 01M2A821M48VWSZ0JGXMA4WWZ7, 2026-09-12T07:24:38Z): fixed by cipher at baf1903c3." ;
  triage:foundIn triage:BA6 ;
